  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Strengthening - CAFOD Led</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to improve CAFOD&apos;s partnership framework by assessing the performance of CAFOD partner organisation. It provides a way for partner organisation to infer the social benefit created by its activities relative to the resources it invests, and aims to allow its leaders to understand the performance of their organisation over time and in relation to other organisations. The project also seek better ways to deliver programmes/ activities while improving partners&apos; interventions at community level.</narrative>
  </description>
